<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Shinsegae 1996 net drops.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Shinsegae 1996 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)					 821 vs 1,516</p>
<p>    Net						9.05 vs 14.10</p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,214.88 vs 1,109</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   13.11 vs  21.59</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won) stock    none vs 2.24</p>
<p>					    cash	 10 vs  2</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     0.46 (gain) vs 13.79 (gain)</p>
<p>    Div Register					Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Payment					 Mar 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinsegae Department Store Co Ltd's share capital increased 1.54 million to 11.20 million in 1996 due to rights offerings and dividend payments.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5649</p>
</text>
